WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.448
At recess that day, I sat on a wall by myself.

2
00:00:06.449 --> 00:00:11.684
Mr. Dalmati marched over to the bumpy slide and blew his whistle.

3
00:00:11.685 --> 00:00:16.994
Kids were pushing each other and arguing about who was first in line.

4
00:00:16.995 --> 00:00:20.352
Molly and Jenny came over to me.

5
00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:24.533
"You're so quiet today, Iggy," said Molly.

6
00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:28.679
"Are you thinking of a new invention?" asked Jenny.

7
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:34.155
"No," I said. "I already thought of one—a Fabulous Glasses-Finder.

8
00:00:34.156 --> 00:00:36.251
But no one wanted to use it.

9
00:00:36.252 --> 00:00:39.715
Now I'm out of ideas."

10
00:00:39.716 --> 00:00:43.690
"Just look around," said Molly, waving her hand.

11
00:00:43.691 --> 00:00:49.463
"Mrs. Romano said you should search for problems right under your nose."

12
00:00:49.464 --> 00:00:52.755
Mr. Dalmati blew his whistle.

13
00:00:52.756 --> 00:00:56.131
"No pushing and shoving!" he said.

14
00:00:56.132 --> 00:01:01.001
The kids waiting to go on the slide were acting wilder than ever.

15
00:01:01.002 --> 00:01:06.131
"I've got a problem," said Jenny. "A big problem."

16
00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:09.031
"What's wrong?" asked Molly.

17
00:01:09.032 --> 00:01:14.516
"I flunked my spelling test today," said Jenny.

18
00:01:14.517 --> 00:01:18.921
"I always get one hundred on my spelling tests."

19
00:01:18.922 --> 00:01:21.958
"Did you study?" I asked.

20
00:01:21.959 --> 00:01:25.091
"I tried to study," said Jenny.

21
00:01:25.092 --> 00:01:27.282
"But I was pretty busy last night.

22
00:01:27.283 --> 00:01:31.146
I have a math test tomorrow, and I was studying for that too.

23
00:01:31.147 --> 00:01:36.840
All those numbers gave me a headache!"

24
00:01:36.841 --> 00:01:40.618
"That is a problem," said Molly.

25
00:01:40.619 --> 00:01:45.941
"I wish you could invent something to help me, Iggy," said Jenny.

26
00:01:45.942 --> 00:01:50.450
"I'm having a lot of trouble at school lately."

27
00:01:50.451 --> 00:01:53.920
"I'm sure I can think of something," I said.

28
00:01:53.921 --> 00:01:56.845
I couldn't believe I said that!

29
00:01:56.846 --> 00:02:00.406
I had no idea how to fix Jenny's problem.

30
00:02:00.407 --> 00:02:04.698
"Oh, Iggy, that would be great!" said Jenny.

31
00:02:04.699 --> 00:02:07.341
Jenny looked so hopeful.

32
00:02:07.342 --> 00:02:10.938
Now I had to find a way to help her.

33
00:02:10.939 --> 00:02:18.304
After school Molly and I stopped at Josh and Jenny's apartment.

34
00:02:18.305 --> 00:02:21.767
Jenny showed her dad her spelling test.

35
00:02:21.768 --> 00:02:24.406
Mr. Chen looked upset.

36
00:02:24.407 --> 00:02:28.159
"Jenny, what happened?" he asked.

37
00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:32.482
"You usually get all the words right on your spelling tests!" "I

38
00:02:32.483 --> 00:02:35.733
know," said Jenny. "I

39
00:02:35.734 --> 00:02:38.518
just can't seem to pay attention lately. And

40
00:02:38.519 --> 00:02:41.528
I have a math test tomorrow." "Try

41
00:02:41.529 --> 00:02:45.316
to study hard tonight," Mr. Chen said. "I

42
00:02:45.317 --> 00:02:46.434
can help you. And

43
00:02:46.435 --> 00:02:50.861
if you're still having problems, I'll speak to your teacher." We

44
00:02:50.862 --> 00:02:55.957
sat down at Josh and Jenny's kitchen table to have a snack. Mr.

45
00:02:55.958 --> 00:03:00.625
Chen went into his magic room to practice his tricks. He

46
00:03:00.626 --> 00:03:03.822
was planning a new magic show. "Too

47
00:03:03.823 --> 00:03:10.371
bad your dad doesn't have a magic trick to fix your problem," Molly said to Jenny. Josh

48
00:03:10.372 --> 00:03:16.196
laughed. "Right now Dad is practicing cutting people in half!" "Hey,

49
00:03:16.197 --> 00:03:21.115
isn't that division?" joked Molly. "I've

50
00:03:21.116 --> 00:03:27.006
already told Dad that I don't want to be cut in half," said Jenny. "It's

51
00:03:27.007 --> 00:03:30.910
just a trick, Jenny," said Josh. "Dad

52
00:03:30.911 --> 00:03:34.048
doesn't really cut people in half. But

53
00:03:34.049 --> 00:03:38.214
he could turn you into a rabbit," he teased her. "I

54
00:03:38.215 --> 00:03:43.131
don't think a rabbit would get good grades on spelling," I pointed out. That

55
00:03:43.132 --> 00:03:48.464
made everyone laugh, even Jenny. "Wait

56
00:03:48.465 --> 00:03:49.613
a minute. Look

57
00:03:49.614 --> 00:03:52.301
at this!" said Molly. She

58
00:03:52.302 --> 00:03:54.989
picked up a book from the table. The

59
00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:59.665
title was Hypnosis Made Easy .

60
00:03:59.666 --> 00:04:03.466
"We could hypnotize you, Jenny!" said Molly.

61
00:04:03.467 --> 00:04:08.171
"Then you might be able to tell us why you're having trouble in school."

62
00:04:08.172 --> 00:04:10.730
"Yeah!" I chimed in.

63
00:04:10.731 --> 00:04:14.656
"I saw a lady hypnotize someone on TV once.

64
00:04:14.657 --> 00:04:18.323
It's simple. First the hypnotist put a man in a trance.

65
00:04:18.325 --> 00:04:22.416
She made him act like a chicken and asked him a bunch of questions.

66
00:04:22.417 --> 00:04:26.589
Then later she woke him up."

67
00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:30.511
But Jenny looked worried by our idea.

68
00:04:30.512 --> 00:04:34.517
"What if you can't wake me up again?" she said.

69
00:04:34.518 --> 00:04:37.366
"I'd be hypnotized forever."

70
00:04:37.367 --> 00:04:39.512
She shook her head.

71
00:04:39.513 --> 00:04:47.312
"Maybe you should cut me in half instead!"

